From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Oct 2026 19:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: tapping the preview clock does not crash the picker

Tapping the preview clock toggled the round and sharp presets, which
frameworks_base 0091 pins to sharp, and announced it with a snackbar
whose text appearance failed to resolve android:textColorLink in this
theme stack, crashing the picker. The tap is no longer offered. The
width slider stays; frameworks_base 0111 makes it work with every font.

---
diff --git a/src/com/android/wallpaper/customization/ui/binder/ThemePickerCustomizationOptionBinder.kt b/src/com/android/wallpaper/customization/ui/binder/ThemePickerCustomizationOptionBinder.kt
--- a/src/com/android/wallpaper/customization/ui/binder/ThemePickerCustomizationOptionBinder.kt
+++ b/src/com/android/wallpaper/customization/ui/binder/ThemePickerCustomizationOptionBinder.kt
@@ -780,8 +780,11 @@
                             ::Pair,
                         )
                         .collect { (selectedOption, onClockFaceClicked) ->
+                            // Kompakt: no tap on the preview clock; its round or sharp toggle is
+                            // pinned to sharp, and its snackbar crashed the picker.
                             if (
-                                selectedOption == ThemePickerLockCustomizationOption.CLOCK &&
+                                false &&
+                                    selectedOption == ThemePickerLockCustomizationOption.CLOCK &&
                                     onClockFaceClicked != null
                             ) {
                                 clockFaceClickDelegateView.isVisible = true
-- 
2.43.0
